NOTE ON THE CORPUS

This licence covers the CODE AND DOCUMENTATION in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the source texts the system indexes. No corpus text is
distributed here by design (see docs/adr/003-ship-manifests-not-corpus.md).
Each source carries its own terms, recorded in corpus/sources.yaml — several
are under active copyright and are cited and linked rather than reproduced.
Running the ingestion pipeline makes you responsible for the terms of whatever
you ingest.
